https://github.com/rynfar/meridian plugin/pi + plugin/priority-attestation.ts, as shipped in
@rynfar/meridian 1.87.0 (MIT, per its package.json). index.ts is the entry point `meridian setup
--client pi` writes. Copied by hand because that setup refuses pi before 1.0 (this machine runs
0.87.1, whose extension API the add-on works with).

Local changes, marked "Local change" in the source:
- pi/index.ts: no built-in fallback key; only a pi account holding a "meridian" credential offers it.
- pi/catalog.ts: Claude 5 models pi does not know get a 128k output limit instead of 8k.
